# 19. Полный pipeline в Python

В итоге `pipeline.py` может выглядеть так:

```python
from .analyzer import analyze_sentence
from .rules import detect_grammar
from .vocabulary import detect_vocabulary
from .scorer import calculate_result
from .ai_fallback import classify_with_ai


def classify_sentence(text: str) -> dict:
    # 1. NLP
    doc = analyze_sentence(text)

    # 2. Grammar rules
    grammar = detect_grammar(doc)

    # 3. Vocabulary
    vocabulary = detect_vocabulary(doc)

    # 4. Local scoring
    result = calculate_result(
        text=text,
        grammar_features=grammar,
        vocabulary_features=vocabulary
    )

    # 5. AI fallback
    if result["confidence"] < 0.80:
        ai_result = classify_with_ai(
            text=text,
            grammar_features=grammar,
            vocabulary_features=vocabulary
        )

        result = merge_results(
            local=result,
            ai=ai_result
        )

    return result
```

Это и есть основа системы.

